"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials15ProgressManagerC8PropertyP7SummaryQa"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"parentSummary","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The current summary value of the parent progress manager."}]}]},{"name":"selfSummary","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The final summary value from the progress manager being deinitialized."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Return Value","type":"heading","anchor":"return-value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The updated summary that replaces the parent’s current summary."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method is used when a progress manager in the hierarchy is being"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deinitialized and its accumulated summary needs to be processed in relation to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its parent’s summary. The behavior can vary depending on the property type:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For additive properties (like file counts, byte counts): The self summary","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is typically added to the parent summary to preserve the accumulated progress.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For max-based properties (like estimated time remaining): The parent summary","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is typically preserved as it represents an existing estimate.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For collection-based properties (like file URLs): The self summary may be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"discarded to avoid accumulating stale references.","type":"te